The needs-you filter matched dot states unread / needs-input, but since the
stripe change a read session with a finished turn (idle + messages) is still
green. With no unread rows the filter found nothing and fell back to the plain
neighbour, landing on unstriped rows. Eligibility is now sessionStatusStripe
(the stripe the row draws) and there is no fallback; archive → next keeps it.
---
